;; fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba): parsing/location.ml's batch-mode report printer
;; (batch_mode_printer for Report_error, Doc.loc, highlight_quote with its ISet, infer_line_numbers and lines_around),
;; utils/format_doc.ml's pp_two_columns, and the part of stdlib/format.ml a message's break hints need (Pp_box and
;; Pp_hovbox, margin 78), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Xavier Leroy, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
